        {
          "path": "_m/9/q/8/z/san-francisco-bay-area-wp/bobcat-flickr-becky-matsubara.jpg",
          "filename": "Bobcat - Flickr - Becky Matsubara.jpg",
          "caption": "Sobrante Ridge Regional Preserve, Richmond, Contra Costa County, California\nExplored 9/05/19, Positions 13 - 15\n\nAs I walked the Sobrante Ridge Trail this morning I looked up and saw this bobcat sitting in the grass and watching me. As long as I didn't move, it just stayed still and stared. Every time I took a few steps down the trail, it would act like it was thinking of leaving, but as soon as I stopped walking it would sit back down and continue to stare at me. Finally, it had enough of me and slowly walked away. Definitely a first for me.",
          "alt": "Sobrante Ridge Regional Preserve, Richmond, Contra Costa County, California\nExplored 9/05/19, Positions 13 - 15\n\nAs I walked the Sobrante Ridge Trail this morning I looked up and saw this bobcat sitting in the grass and watching me. As long as I didn't move, it just stayed still and stared. Every time I took a few steps down the trail, it would act like it was thinking of leaving, but as soon as I stopped walking it would sit back down and continue to stare at me. Finally, it had enough of me and slowly walked away. Definitely a first for me.",
          "width": 2389,
          "height": 1593,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY 2.0",
          "artist": "Becky Matsubara from El Sobrante, California",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bobcat_-_Flickr_-_Becky_Matsubara.jpg",
          "sourceType": "poi",
          "sourceArticleId": "san-francisco-bay-area-wp",
